ess-facial-medford-ma","priceSpecification":{"@type":"PriceSpecification","price":"80.00","priceCurrency":"USD"},"itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","serviceType":"Facial","name":"VITALIS Glow Express Facial","description":"VITALIS Glow Express Facial is a results-driven, 30-minute treatment designed to quickly refresh, smooth, and brighten your complexion. Ideal for busy schedules, lunch breaks, or a pre-event pick-me-up, this targeted service focuses on restoring hydration, radiance, and balance with professional skincare tailored to your skin's immediate needs. Your esthetician will perform a thorough cleanse and gentle exfoliation to remove buildup and dullness, followed by a revitalizing mask to boost glow and replenish moisture. The treatment is completed with toner, a customized serum, eye and lip care, and a hydrating moisturizer with SPF to protect and perfect your skin. You'll leave with a softer, more luminous, and refreshed complexion, all in under half an hour.","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/all-services/p/express-facial-medford-ma","provider":{"@id":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/#spa"}}},{"@type":"Offer","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/all-services/p/mesotherapy-facial-medford-ma","priceSpecification":{"@type":"PriceSpecification","price":"100.00","priceCurrency":"USD"},"itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","serviceType":"Facial","name":"VITALIS Mesotherapy Rejuvenation Facial","description":"The VITALIS Mesotherapy Rejuvenation Facial at Vitalis Luxe Spa is an advanced, non-surgical treatment designed to deeply nourish, hydrate, and revitalize the skin from within. This facial combines professional-grade skincare with targeted mesotherapy techniques, delivering a customized cocktail of vitamins, antioxidants, hyaluronic acid, and rejuvenating ingredients directly into the superficial layers of the skin. After a thorough cleanse and gentle exfoliation, your esthetician uses precise, micro-delivery methods to infuse these actives where they are needed most, helping to boost collagen, improve elasticity, and support healthy skin function. The result is a smoother, plumper, and more radiant complexion with improved tone and texture, and a visible reduction in dullness and early signs of aging. Ideal for clients seeking deep hydration, glow, and overall skin renewal, the VITALIS Mesotherapy Rejuvenation Facial leaves the skin looking refreshed, dewy, and rejuvenated, with optimal results when received in a series as part of a personalized skincare plan.","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/all-services/p/mesotherapy-facial-medford-ma","provider":{"@id":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/#spa"}}},{"@type":"Offer","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/all-services/p/signature-facial-medford-ma","priceSpecification":{"@type":"PriceSpecification","price":"120.00","priceCurrency":"USD"},"itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","serviceType":"Facial","name":"VITALIS Signature Radiance Facial","description":"The VITALIS Signature Radiance Facial is a one-hour, results-driven treatment designed to restore your natural glow while deeply relaxing the mind and body. This luxurious service combines rich, sensorial textures with high-performance formulas packed with natural vitamins and antioxidants to nourish, protect, and brighten the skin. Your facial begins with a gentle double cleanse and tone to purify and balance, followed by customized exfoliation to smooth and refine your skin's texture. A targeted treatment mask is then selected to address your unique concerns, whether that's dullness, dehydration, or uneven tone. A relaxing facial massage boosts circulation and radiance, while concentrated serums work to improve the appearance of fine lines and revitalize the complexion. Dedicated eye and lip care soften and hydrate the delicate areas, and a nourishing neck treatment ensures a seamlessly rejuvenated look. The service is completed with a finishing moisturizer and SPF to lock in hydration and shield the skin. Ideal for anyone seeking both visible radiance and deep relaxation, this facial leaves the complexion supple, refreshed, and beautifully illuminated.","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/all-services/p/signature-facial-medford-ma","provider":{"@id":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/#spa"}}},{"@type":"Offer","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/all-services/p/rf-skin-tightening-facial-medford-ma","priceSpecification":{"@type":"PriceSpecification","price":"100.00","priceCurrency":"USD"},"itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","serviceType":"Facial","name":"VITALIS RF Skin Tightening Facial","description":"The VITALIS RF Lifting & Firming Facial at Vitalis Luxe Spa is an advanced anti-aging treatment designed to tighten, lift, and rejuvenate the skin. This facial combines targeted skincare with radiofrequency (RF) technology, which gently heats the deeper layers of the skin to stimulate collagen and elastin production without damaging the surface. Your esthetician will cleanse and prepare the skin, then glide the RF device over key areas of the face, focusing on areas prone to laxity such as the cheeks, jawline, and under the chin. As the tissue warms, collagen fibers contract and new collagen is gradually produced, helping to improve firmness, refine contours, and soften the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles over time. Soothing, hydrating products are then applied to nourish the skin and enhance your post-treatment glow. Ideal for clients seeking non-invasive skin tightening and long-term rejuvenation, the VITALIS RF Lifting & Firming Facial leaves the complexion looking smoother, more lifted, and refreshed, with best results seen in a series as part of a customized skincare plan.","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/all-services/p/rf-skin-tightening-facial-medford-ma","provider":{"@id":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/#spa"}}},{"@type":"Offer","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/all-services/p/hydrodermabrasion-facial-medford-ma","priceSpecification":{"@type":"PriceSpecification","price":"130.00","priceCurrency":"USD"},"itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","serviceType":"Facial","name":"VITALIS AquaGlow Hydradermabrasion Facial","description":"A water-powered resurfacing facial that exfoliates and deeply hydrates in a single step. A diamond-tip wand glides over serum-infused skin to sweep away dull, dead cells and gently clear congestion and blackheads, with no crystals, no scraping, and no downtime, while nourishing serums are driven into the fresh skin beneath. Your experience includes a double cleanse, diamond hydra-exfoliation and extractions, a targeted serum infusion, a revitalizing mask, eye and lip care, moisturizer, and SPF. Gentle enough for sensitive skin yet effective enough to refine texture, decongest pores, and restore an instant, healthy glow, for all skin types and tones.","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/all-services/p/hydrodermabrasion-facial-medford-ma","provider":{"@id":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/#spa"}}},{"@type":"Offer","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/all-services/p/teen-facial-medford-ma","priceSpecification":{"@type":"PriceSpecification","price":"80.00","priceCurrency":"USD"},"itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","serviceType":"Facial","name":"VITALIS Fresh Start Teen Facial","description":"The VITALIS Fresh Start Teen Facial is a gentle, education-focused treatment created specifically for teenage skin, ages 12 to 18. Designed to decongest, calm, and refresh without harsh actives, this facial helps young clients establish healthy skin habits early. Your esthetician begins with a thorough consultation and double cleanse, followed by a skin analysis and a mild enzyme or low-strength exfoliation to gently lift away buildup. Light steam and careful, comedone-only extractions clear congestion, while a purifying or soothing mask calms and balances the complexion. The treatment finishes with a lightweight, non-comedogenic moisturizer and SPF, plus simple, personalized home-care guidance. Ideal for teens dealing with breakouts, blackheads, or oily skin, this facial leaves the complexion clearer, calmer, and refreshed. A parent or guardian's consent is required, and we welcome them to attend.","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/all-services/p/teen-facial-medford-ma","provider":{"@id":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/#spa"}}},{"@type":"Offer","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/all-services/p/acne-facial-medford-ma","priceSpecification":{"@type":"PriceSpecification","price":"130.00","priceCurrency":"USD"},"itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","serviceType":"Facial","name":"VITALIS Clear Skin Acne Facial","description":"The VITALIS Clear Skin Acne Facial is a deep-cleansing, results-driven treatment designed to calm active breakouts and decongest acne-prone skin while protecting the skin barrier. After a detailed consultation and double cleanse, your esthetician performs a skin analysis and applies a salicylic or enzyme exfoliation to dissolve excess oil and surface buildup. Gentle steam and hygienic extractions clear comedones and surface congestion, while high-frequency or blue LED light helps target blemish-causing bacteria. A purifying clay or sulfur mask is balanced with soothing, hydrating actives to reduce inflammation without over-drying. The facial finishes with a lightweight, non-comedogenic moisturizer and SPF. Best experienced in a series of treatments spaced every two to four weeks, this facial helps reveal a clearer, calmer, more balanced complexion. For moderate to severe or cystic acne, we may recommend partnering with your dermatologist.","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/all-services/p/acne-facial-medford-ma","provider":{"@id":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/#spa"}}},{"@type":"Offer","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/all-services/p/rosacea-facial-medford-ma","priceSpecification":{"@type":"PriceSpecification","price":"130.00","priceCurrency":"USD"},"itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","serviceType":"Facial","name":"VITALIS Calming Redness Relief Facial","description":"The VITALIS Calming Redness Relief Facial is a soothing, barrier-strengthening treatment created for sensitive, reactive, and rosacea-prone skin. Every step is deliberately gentle and cooling, with no steam, scrubs, or strong acids that could trigger flare-ups. Your esthetician begins with a single mild, non-foaming cleanse and a careful skin analysis, then layers anti-inflammatory and hydrating actives such as niacinamide, centella, and hyaluronic acid to quiet visible redness and reinforce the moisture barrier. A soothing mask and calming red or yellow LED light, along with cooling globes, help reduce the look of redness and sensitivity. The treatment finishes with a protective barrier moisturizer and a gentle mineral SPF. Ideal for those who experience persistent redness, flushing, or easily irritated skin, this facial leaves the complexion calmer, more comfortable, and more resilient, with best results as part of an ongoing, trigger-aware skincare plan.","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/all-services/p/rosacea-facial-medford-ma","provider":{"@id":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/#spa"}}},{"@type":"Offer","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/all-services/p/anti-aging-facial-medford-ma","priceSpecification":{"@type":"PriceSpecification","price":"160.00","priceCurrency":"USD"},"itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","serviceType":"Facial","name":"VITALIS Timeless Lift Anti-Aging Facial","description":"The VITALIS Timeless Lift Anti-Aging Facial is our premium, 75-minute treatment devoted to firmer, smoother, more radiant mature skin. This indulgent service pairs advanced corrective actives with deeply relaxing techniques for visible, sensorial results. After a double cleanse and detailed skin analysis, your esthetician refines the skin with a gentle enzyme and light exfoliation, then layers concentrated peptide, antioxidant, and collagen-supporting serums to target the look of fine lines and loss of firmness. A sculpting facial and lymphatic massage lifts and energizes the contours of the face, neck, and decollete, while a firming treatment mask and rejuvenating red LED light help boost radiance and resilience. Dedicated eye and lip care soften delicate areas, and a nourishing moisturizer with SPF locks in hydration and protects your results. Ideal for clients focused on anti-aging and firming, this facial leaves the complexion lifted, luminous, and refreshed, with cumulative results in a series.","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/all-services/p/anti-aging-facial-medford-ma","provider":{"@id":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/#spa"}}},{"@type":"Offer","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/all-services/p/melasma-facial-medford-ma","priceSpecification":{"@type":"PriceSpecification","price":"130.00","priceCurrency":"USD"},"itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","serviceType":"Facial","name":"VITALIS Luminous Brightening Facial","description":"The VITALIS Luminous Brightening Facial is a gentle, results-focused treatment designed to even skin tone and soften the look of dark spots, sun damage, and melasma. Because pigment concerns are sensitive to heat and inflammation, every step is intentionally calm and brightening rather than aggressive. Following a double cleanse and skin analysis, your esthetician applies a gentle brightening exfoliation, such as mandelic or lactic acid, suited to your skin tone and sensitivity. Targeted brightening actives, including vitamin C, tranexamic acid, kojic acid, and niacinamide, work to interrupt excess pigment and restore clarity, while a brightening, antioxidant-rich mask enhances luminosity. The treatment finishes with a hydrating moisturizer and a mandatory mineral broad-spectrum SPF, with personalized sun-protection guidance that is essential to maintaining results. Ideal for uneven tone, hyperpigmentation, and melasma, this facial reveals a brighter, more even, more radiant complexion, with best results in a customized series.","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/all-services/p/melasma-facial-medford-ma","provider":{"@id":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/#spa"}}},{"@type":"Offer","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/all-services/p/hydrating-facial-medford-ma","priceSpecification":{"@type":"PriceSpecification","price":"100.00","priceCurrency":"USD"},"itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","serviceType":"Facial","name":"VITALIS Hydra Quench Hydrating Facial","description":"The VITALIS Hydra Quench Hydrating Facial is a soothing, moisture-replenishing treatment that restores softness, bounce, and luminosity to dry, dehydrated, or stressed skin. Perfect year-round and especially in cold or dry months, this gentle facial floods the complexion with lasting hydration. After a double cleanse and skin analysis, your esthetician applies a mild enzyme exfoliation to smooth the surface, then layers replenishing actives such as hyaluronic acid, glycerin, ceramides, and panthenol to attract and seal in moisture. A relaxing massage and a hydrating gel or biocellulose mask deeply quench the skin, with an optional hyaluronic nano-infusion to enhance absorption. The treatment finishes with a barrier-supporting moisturizer and SPF. Ideal for tight, flaky, dull, or travel-stressed skin, this facial leaves the complexion plump, dewy, and refreshed, and is beautifully suited to sensitive skin and a perfect reset any time your skin feels parched.","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/all-services/p/hydrating-facial-medford-ma","provider":{"@id":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/#spa"}}},{"@type":"Offer","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/all-services/p/mens-facial-medford-ma","priceSpecification":{"@type":"PriceSpecification","price":"95.00","priceCurrency":"USD"},"itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","serviceType":"Facial","name":"VITALIS Gentleman's Facial","description":"The VITALIS Gentleman's Facial is a deep-cleansing, refreshing treatment tailored to the needs of men's skin, with a focus on managing congestion, shaving irritation, and ingrown hairs. After a consultation and double cleanse, your esthetician performs a skin analysis and a clarifying enzyme or BHA exfoliation to decongest pores and smooth rough texture. Warm steam and thorough extractions clear buildup, while soothing, anti-redness care calms areas affected by shaving. A purifying yet hydrating mask balances the skin, and the treatment finishes with a lightweight, non-greasy moisturizer and SPF. Ideal for men who want clearer, healthier, better-groomed skin with no fuss, this facial leaves the complexion clean, calm, and refreshed, and includes simple, realistic home-care advice to keep skin looking its best between visits.","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/all-services/p/mens-facial-medford-ma","provider":{"@id":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/#spa"}}},{"@type":"Offer","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/all-services/p/dermaplaning-facial-medford-ma","priceSpecification":{"@type":"PriceSpecification","price":"110.00","priceCurrency":"USD"},"itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","serviceType":"Facial","name":"VITALIS Smooth Glow Dermaplaning Facial","description":"A complete facial built around dermaplaning for skin that looks instantly smoother and more luminous. Using a sterile, medical-grade blade, we remove dead surface cells and soft, fine facial hair, then layer a full facial around it, cleanse, a tailored mask, targeted serums, moisturizer, and SPF, so skincare absorbs better and makeup glides on flawlessly. The result is brighter, softer, refined skin with zero downtime. Ideal before special events or as a monthly glow ritual, and a beautiful pairing with a light peel. Best for most skin types; not recommended during active acne breakouts.","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/all-services/p/dermaplaning-facial-medford-ma","provider":{"@id":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/#spa"}}},{"@type":"Offer","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/all-services/p/deluxe-hydrodermabrasion-facial-medford-ma","priceSpecification":{"@type":"PriceSpecification","price":"160.00","priceCurrency":"USD"},"itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","serviceType":"Facial","name":"VITALIS AquaGlow Deluxe Hydradermabrasion Facial","description":"Our most complete hydradermabrasion experience. It begins with the full AquaGlow treatment, diamond-tip hydra-exfoliation, extractions, and a targeted serum infusion, then layers on the advanced modalities our platform makes possible: a revitalizing oxygen infusion to flood the skin with hydration and radiance, optional radio-frequency to firm and lift, and a soothing cooling step to calm and seal. The result is deeper hydration, a more sculpted, lifted finish, and an even more luminous glow. Includes a double cleanse, mask, eye and lip care, moisturizer, and SPF. Ideal before an event or as a monthly indulgence, for all skin types and tones.","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/all-services/p/deluxe-hydrodermabrasion-facial-medford-ma","provider":{"@id":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/#spa"}}}]},{"@type":"OfferCatalog","name":"Microneedling","itemListElement":[{"@type":"Offer","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/all-services/p/microneedling-hyaluronic-acid-medford-ma","priceSpecification":{"@type":"PriceSpecification","price":"180.00","priceCurrency":"USD"},"itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","serviceType":"Microneedling","name":"VITALIS Microneedling with Hyaluronic Acid","description":"A professional treatment designed to stimulate the skin's natural healing process and boost collagen production for smoother, firmer, and more even-looking skin. Using fine, sterile needles, controlled micro-channels activate collagen and elastin renewal while we infuse hyaluronic acid as a standard part of every treatment to deeply hydrate and plump the skin. This combination helps improve fine lines, acne scars, stretch marks, and overall skin texture. Best results are achieved with a series of treatments for progressively healthier, more radiant skin.","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/all-services/p/microneedling-hyaluronic-acid-medford-ma","provider":{"@id":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/#spa"}}},{"@type":"Offer","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/all-services/p/microneedling-peptides-medford-ma","priceSpecification":{"@type":"PriceSpecification","price":"230.00","priceCurrency":"USD"},"itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","serviceType":"Microneedling","name":"VITALIS Microneedling with Triple Peptides","description":"Elevate your results with our Microneedling + Triple Peptide Infusion treatment at Vitalis Luxe Spa. This advanced service builds on our standard microneedling, which uses fine, sterile needles and hyaluronic acid to create controlled micro-channels, stimulate collagen and elastin, and deeply hydrate the skin. We then enhance your session with a professional triple peptide serum, featuring three targeted peptides designed to support repair, boost firmness, and smooth the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles. As the peptides are infused through the freshly created micro-channels, they penetrate more effectively to help improve texture, elasticity, and overall radiance. Ideal for those focused on anti-aging and skin rejuvenation, this upgraded treatment delivers a more lifted, refined, and youthful-looking complexion, especially when performed in a series as part of a customized skincare plan.","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/all-services/p/microneedling-peptides-medford-ma","provider":{"@id":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/#spa"}}},{"@type":"Offer","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/all-services/p/microneedling-chemical-peel-medford-ma","priceSpecification":{"@type":"PriceSpecification","price":"230.00","priceCurrency":"USD"},"itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","serviceType":"Microneedling","name":"VITALIS Microneedling with Chemical Peel","description":"Experience intensified skin rejuvenation with our combined Microneedling, Chemical Peel treatment at Vitalis Luxe Spa. This advanced service pairs our standard microneedling, using fine, sterile needles and hyaluronic acid infusion to stimulate collagen, elastin, and deep hydration, with a customized chemical peel selected for your unique skin type and concerns. The peel works to dissolve dull, damaged surface cells and target issues such as discoloration, congestion, and uneven tone, while microneedling's controlled micro-channels support deeper renewal from within. Together, they help visibly improve fine lines, acne scars, enlarged pores, sun damage, and overall texture for smoother, firmer, more radiant skin. Your esthetician will tailor both the microneedling settings and peel strength to your comfort level and goals. For transformative, longer-lasting results, this treatment is best performed in a series as part of a personalized skin-rejuvenation plan.","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/all-services/p/microneedling-chemical-peel-medford-ma","provider":{"@id":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/#spa"}}},{"@type":"Offer","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/all-services/p/microneedling-collagen-medford-ma","priceSpecification":{"@type":"PriceSpecification","price":"230.00","priceCurrency":"USD"},"itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","serviceType":"Microneedling","name":"VITALIS Microneedling with Collagen","description":"Elevate your results with our Microneedling + Collagen Infusion treatment at Vitalis Luxe Spa. This advanced service builds on our standard microneedling, which uses fine, sterile needles and hyaluronic acid to create controlled micro-channels, stimulate collagen and elastin, and deeply hydrate the skin. We then enhance your session with a professional collagen infusion, using a concentrated collagen serum designed to support repair, boost firmness, and improve the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles. As the collagen is infused through the freshly created micro-channels, it penetrates more effectively to help enhance texture, elasticity, and overall radiance. Ideal for those focused on anti-aging and skin rejuvenation, this upgraded treatment delivers a plumper, more lifted, and youthful-looking complexion, especially when performed in a series as part of a customized skincare plan.","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/all-services/p/microneedling-collagen-medford-ma","provider":{"@id":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/#spa"}}},{"@type":"Offer","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/all-services/p/nanoneedling-lips-medford-ma","priceSpecification":{"@type":"PriceSpecification","price":"90.00","priceCurrency":"USD"},"itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","serviceType":"Microneedling","name":"VITALIS Nanoneedling Lip Infusion","description":"A luxurious lip treatment designed to deeply hydrate, smooth, and revitalize the lips using advanced nano microneedling technology. This gentle procedure creates micro-channels that enhance the absorption of nourishing ingredients, helping improve lip texture, hydration, and natural fullness. The treatment includes gentle exfoliation, targeted hydration, and a restorative lip mask, leaving lips visibly softer, smoother, and naturally radiant.","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/all-services/p/nanoneedling-lips-medford-ma","provider":{"@id":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/#spa"}}}]},{"@type":"OfferCatalog","name":"Peels","itemListElement":[{"@type":"Offer","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/all-services/p/enzyme-peel-medford-ma","priceSpecification":{"@type":"PriceSpecification","price":"100.00","priceCurrency":"USD"},"itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","serviceType":"Chemical Peel","name":"VITALIS Enzymatic Glow Peel","description":"Reveal a fresh, healthy glow with a gentle enzymatic peel at Vitalis Luxe Spa. Unlike traditional acid-based peels, our enzymatic peels use naturally derived fruit enzymes to softly dissolve and lift away dull, dead skin cells from the surface, delivering radiance without harshness. Each treatment is fully customized to your unique skin type, sensitivity level, and concerns, making it an ideal option for even the most delicate or reactive skin. Your esthetician will begin with a thorough skin analysis, then select the ideal enzyme blend and supporting products based on whether your skin is dry, oily, combination, sensitive, or prone to redness. This tailored approach helps brighten dull, tired skin, smooth the look of uneven texture, boost clarity, and enhance hydration, all while respecting your skin's natural barrier. Enzymatic peels are perfect when you want an immediate, event-ready glow with little to no downtime and minimal risk of irritation. After your treatment, you can expect skin that looks more luminous and feels softer, with improved absorption of your home-care products. At Vitalis Luxe Spa, our enzymatic peel is a soothing, results-driven experience designed to reveal your most radiant complexion, gently and safely.","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/all-services/p/enzyme-peel-medford-ma","provider":{"@id":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/#spa"}}},{"@type":"Offer","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/all-services/p/lactic-peel-medford-ma","priceSpecification":{"@type":"PriceSpecification","price":"110.00","priceCurrency":"USD"},"itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","serviceType":"Chemical Peel","name":"VITALIS Hydra-Smooth Lactic Peel","description":"The VITALIS Hydra-Smooth Lactic Peel is a gentle, hydrating alpha-hydroxy peel ideal for dry, sensitive, or first-time peel clients. Lactic acid is the mildest of the AHAs, gently dissolving dull surface cells while drawing moisture into the skin, so you brighten and smooth without the sting of stronger acids. After a double cleanse and skin analysis, your esthetician applies a customized, superficial lactic solution suited to your skin's tolerance, then neutralizes and layers soothing, hydrating actives. The treatment finishes with a barrier-supporting moisturizer and broad-spectrum SPF. Expect softer texture, a fresher glow, and better product absorption with little to no downtime. Best results come from a gentle series spaced every two to four weeks, and your esthetician will screen for contraindications such as active retinoid use, recent exfoliation, or pregnancy before treatment.","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/all-services/p/lactic-peel-medford-ma","provider":{"@id":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/#spa"}}},{"@type":"Offer","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/all-services/p/glycolic-peel-medford-ma","priceSpecification":{"@type":"PriceSpecification","price":"120.00","priceCurrency":"USD"},"itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","serviceType":"Chemical Peel","name":"VITALIS Resurfacing Glycolic Peel","description":"The VITALIS Resurfacing Glycolic Peel is a brightening, texture-refining alpha-hydroxy peel for clients focused on dullness, fine lines, and uneven tone. Glycolic acid has the smallest molecule of the AHAs, allowing it to exfoliate efficiently for visibly smoother, more radiant skin. Kept at a superficial, esthetician-appropriate strength, the peel is fully customized to your skin. After a double cleanse and skin analysis, your esthetician applies the glycolic solution, monitors carefully, then neutralizes and replenishes the skin with antioxidant and hydrating actives before finishing with moisturizer and broad-spectrum SPF. Expect a fresher, more even, more luminous complexion and improved absorption of your home-care products. Glycolic peels deliver their best results in a progressive series, and your esthetician will screen for contraindications, including recent retinoid use, sun exposure, and sensitivity, before each treatment.","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/all-services/p/glycolic-peel-medford-ma","provider":{"@id":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/#spa"}}},{"@type":"Offer","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/all-services/p/mandelic-peel-medford-ma","priceSpecification":{"@type":"PriceSpecification","price":"120.00","priceCurrency":"USD"},"itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","serviceType":"Chemical Peel","name":"VITALIS Even Tone Mandelic Peel","description":"The VITALIS Even Tone Mandelic Peel is a gentle, pigment-friendly alpha-hydroxy peel designed to even skin tone and soften dark spots, post-acne marks, and melasma. Mandelic acid's larger molecule penetrates slowly and evenly, making it one of the safest peels for sensitive skin, melasma, and deeper skin tones, where stronger acids carry a higher risk of irritation and post-inflammatory pigmentation. After a double cleanse and skin analysis, your esthetician applies a customized superficial mandelic solution, then neutralizes and layers brightening, calming actives, finishing with a hydrating moisturizer and a mandatory mineral broad-spectrum SPF. Diligent sun protection at home is essential to your results. Expect a clearer, brighter, more even complexion over a gentle series spaced every two to four weeks. Your esthetician will screen for contraindications before treatment, and this peel is a natural follow-on to the Luminous Brightening Facial.","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/all-services/p/mandelic-peel-medford-ma","provider":{"@id":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/#spa"}}},{"@type":"Offer","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/all-services/p/salicylic-peel-medford-ma","priceSpecification":{"@type":"PriceSpecification","price":"115.00","priceCurrency":"USD"},"itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","serviceType":"Chemical Peel","name":"VITALIS Clarifying Salicylic Peel","description":"The VITALIS Clarifying Salicylic Peel is a decongesting beta-hydroxy peel created for oily, congested, and acne-prone skin. Salicylic acid is oil-soluble, so it penetrates into the pores to dissolve buildup, calm blemishes, and refine the look of enlarged pores. Kept within a superficial, esthetician-appropriate strength, the peel is customized to your skin and concerns. After a double cleanse and skin analysis, your esthetician applies the salicylic solution, monitors closely, then soothes and rebalances the skin with calming, hydrating actives before finishing with a lightweight moisturizer and broad-spectrum SPF. Expect clearer, smoother, less congested skin with minimal downtime, and the most visible improvement when booked as a series every two to four weeks alongside the Clear Skin Acne Facial. Your esthetician will screen for contraindications, including isotretinoin use, pregnancy, and aspirin sensitivity, before treatment.","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/all-services/p/salicylic-peel-medford-ma","provider":{"@id":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/#spa"}}}]},{"@type":"OfferCatalog","name":"Facial Massage","itemListElement":[{"@type":"Offer","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/all-services/p/relaxing-facial-massage-medford-ma","priceSpecification":{"@type":"PriceSpecification","price":"80.00","priceCurrency":"USD"},"itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","serviceType":"Facial Massage","name":"VITALIS Relaxing Facial Massage","description":"Experience deep relaxation with our soothing facial massage at Vitalis Luxe Spa. This calming treatment is designed to melt away stress, ease facial tension, and promote a sense of overall well-being. Your esthetician uses gentle, rhythmic massage techniques along the face, neck, and decollete to improve circulation, encourage lymphatic drainage, and relieve tight muscles that can contribute to jaw tension and headaches. Nourishing oils and light pressure help soften the skin, enhance natural radiance, and support a healthy glow, while focused movements around the eyes, temples, and scalp help quiet the mind and calm the nervous system. Ideal as a stand-alone escape or added to any skincare service, our facial massage is perfect for anyone seeking relaxation, stress relief, and a refreshed, rejuvenated complexion.","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/all-services/p/relaxing-facial-massage-medford-ma","provider":{"@id":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/#spa"}}},{"@type":"Offer","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/all-services/p/lymphatic-facial-massage-medford-ma","priceSpecification":{"@type":"PriceSpecification","price":"100.00","priceCurrency":"USD"},"itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","serviceType":"Facial Massage","name":"VITALIS Lymphatic Drainage Facial Massage","description":"Experience the detoxifying benefits of our Lymphatic Drainage Facial Massage at Vitalis Luxe Spa. This gentle, rhythmic treatment is designed to encourage lymph flow, helping to reduce puffiness, support the body's natural detox processes, and promote a clearer, more refined complexion. Your esthetician uses light, precise movements along the face, jawline, neck, and decollete to stimulate lymphatic pathways, ease fluid retention, and soften areas of tension. The result is a more sculpted, lifted appearance with less facial bloating, especially around the eyes and cheeks, along with improved circulation for a healthy, natural glow. Ideal for those who experience puffiness, congestion, or want a calming, wellness-focused treatment, this facial massage leaves you feeling lighter, refreshed, and deeply relaxed, and pairs beautifully with other skincare services as part of a holistic self-care routine.","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/all-services/p/lymphatic-facial-massage-medford-ma","provider":{"@id":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/#spa"}}},{"@type":"Offer","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/all-services/p/eye-massage-medford-ma","priceSpecification":{"@type":"PriceSpecification","price":"80.00","priceCurrency":"USD"},"itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","serviceType":"Facial Massage","name":"VITALIS Radiant Eyes Massage","description":"A transformative eye treatment designed to revitalize the delicate periorbital area through specialized massage techniques. This results-focused ritual combines relaxation with targeted rejuvenation to address fine lines, eye strain, puffiness, and fluid retention while releasing emotional tension held in the eye area. Using 14 carefully crafted massage movements, this treatment works with the unique muscles, bones, and skin structure surrounding the eyes to promote circulation, reduce visible signs of fatigue, and support long-term eye health. The VITALIS Radiant Eyes Ritual leaves the eye area refreshed, lifted, and visibly brighter, ideal as a standalone treatment or as a luxurious addition to any facial service.","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/all-services/p/eye-massage-medford-ma","provider":{"@id":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/#spa"}}}]},{"@type":"OfferCatalog","name":"Add-Ons","itemListElement":[{"@type":"Offer","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/all-services/p/pore-extraction-medford-ma","priceSpecification":{"@type":"PriceSpecification","price":"40.00","priceCurrency":"USD"},"itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","serviceType":"Add-On","name":"VITALIS Pore Extraction","description":"Enhance your treatment with a meticulous Extraction add-on. This refined, hands-on ritual gently clears congested pores, removing impurities and buildup to reveal a smoother, more clarified complexion. By expertly targeting blackheads and congestion, extractions help minimize the appearance of pores, reduce future breakouts, and create the ideal canvas for your skincare, leaving skin looking cleaner, fresher, and beautifully refined.","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/all-services/p/pore-extraction-medford-ma","provider":{"@id":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/#spa"}}},{"@type":"Offer","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/all-services/p/led-facial-therapy-medford-ma","priceSpecification":{"@type":"PriceSpecification","price":"30.00","priceCurrency":"USD"},"itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","serviceType":"Add-On","name":"VITALIS Red & Blue LED Facial Therapy","description":"Enhance your customized facial with targeted light technology designed to calm, clear, and rejuvenate your skin from within. Our VITALIS Red & Blue LED Facial Therapy uses non-invasive LED wavelengths to address multiple skin concerns safely and effectively, without heat, discomfort, or downtime. Red LED light helps stimulate collagen and elastin for firmer, smoother skin, softens the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles, supports skin healing, and reduces the look of redness while improving overall tone, radiance, and resilience. Blue LED light targets acne-causing bacteria at the source, helping to minimize active breakouts and future flare-ups, calm inflammation, and reduce the appearance of post-acne redness for a clearer, more balanced complexion. When combined, red and blue LED work synergistically to promote a healthier skin environment, boost the results of your facial, and extend your post-treatment glow. This gentle, pain-free add-on is suitable for most skin types and is an ideal support for acne-prone, sensitive, or aging skin.","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/all-services/p/led-facial-therapy-medford-ma","provider":{"@id":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/#spa"}}}]},{"@type":"OfferCatalog","name":"3D Skin Analysis","itemListElement":[{"@type":"Offer","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/all-services/p/skin-analysis-medford-ma","priceSpecification":{"@type":"PriceSpecification","price":"0.00","priceCurrency":"USD"},"itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","serviceType":"Skin Analysis","name":"VITALIS 3D Skin Analysis","description":"Reveal what your skin truly needs with our in depth skin analysis. Advanced imaging and 3D facial scanning uncover more than 30 key indicators from your skins hydration and tone to your skin's pores, fine lines, and oil balance. Our team of experts will transform these findings into a clear personalized natural anti aging plan ensuring all treatments are precisely tailored to your unique complexion.","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/all-services/p/skin-analysis-medford-ma","provider":{"@id":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/#spa"}}}]},{"@type":"OfferCatalog","name":"Packages","itemListElement":[{"@type":"Offer","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/all-services/p/acne-treatment-package-medford-ma","availability":"https://schema.org/InStock","priceSpecification":{"@type":"PriceSpecification","price":"675.00","priceCurrency":"USD"},"itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","serviceType":"Acne Treatment Program","name":"VITALIS Clear Skin Acne Program","description":"A guided 6-session program over about 12 weeks to clear breakout-prone skin, alternating deep-cleansing acne facials with clarifying salicylic peels, plus Red and Blue LED at every visit, to calm active acne, decongest pores, and soften post-acne marks. Begins with a skin analysis.","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/all-services/p/acne-treatment-package-medford-ma","provider":{"@id":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/#spa"}}},{"@type":"Offer","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/all-services/p/melasma-treatment-package-medford-ma","availability":"https://schema.org/InStock","priceSpecification":{"@type":"PriceSpecification","price":"675.00","priceCurrency":"USD"},"itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","serviceType":"Melasma and Hyperpigmentation Program","name":"VITALIS Luminous Correction Series","description":"A gentle, pigment-safe 6-session program over about 12 weeks to even tone and fade melasma, dark spots, and post-acne marks, alternating brightening facials with mandelic peels suited to sensitive and deeper skin tones. Begins with a skin analysis and daily sun-protection guidance.","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/all-services/p/melasma-treatment-package-medford-ma","provider":{"@id":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/#spa"}}},{"@type":"Offer","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/all-services/p/microneedling-package-medford-ma","availability":"https://schema.org/InStock","priceSpecification":{"@type":"PriceSpecification","price":"599.00","priceCurrency":"USD"},"itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","serviceType":"Microneedling Package","name":"VITALIS Collagen Renewal Microneedling Course","description":"A 3-session collagen microneedling course spaced 4 to 6 weeks apart, using fine micro-channels and a collagen infusion to firm skin, smooth fine lines, refine pores, and soften acne scars as new collagen builds. Begins with a skin analysis. Optional 4th session available.","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/all-services/p/microneedling-package-medford-ma","provider":{"@id":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/#spa"}}},{"@type":"Offer","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/all-services/p/chemical-peel-package-medford-ma","availability":"https://schema.org/InStock","priceSpecification":{"@type":"PriceSpecification","price":"399.00","priceCurrency":"USD"},"itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","serviceType":"Chemical Peel Package","name":"VITALIS Renewal Peel Series","description":"A progressive 4-peel series over about 8 to 12 weeks, customized each visit from lactic, glycolic, mandelic, and salicylic peels to resurface texture, brighten dull skin, clear congestion, and even tone as your skin adapts. Little to no downtime. Optional 6-peel series available.","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/all-services/p/chemical-peel-package-medford-ma","provider":{"@id":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/#spa"}}},{"@type":"Offer","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/all-services/p/luxury-facial-package-medford-ma","availability":"https://schema.org/InStock","priceSpecification":{"@type":"PriceSpecification","price":"249.00","priceCurrency":"USD"},"itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","serviceType":"Luxury Facial Package","name":"VITALIS Full Radiance Experience","description":"Our most complete single visit, about two hours of layered care combining a signature radiance facial, a lymphatic drainage facial massage to de-puff and sculpt, and a brightening eye treatment, to leave skin lifted, luminous, and deeply nourished. The indulgent reset.","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/all-services/p/luxury-facial-package-medford-ma","provider":{"@id":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/#spa"}}},{"@type":"Offer","url":"https://www.vitalisluxespa.com/all-services/p/bridal-glow-package-medford-ma","availability":"https://schema.org/InStock","priceSpecification":{"@type":"PriceSpecification","price":"34